{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"electricity-cost-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"electricity-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["electricity-cost-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Només una estimació. L' energia real pot diferir perquè els aparells fan cicles, treuen energia en espera o usen diferents arranjaments. La vostra factura també pot incloure tarifes de temps d' ús, impostos, preus escalonats i tarifes específiques de les utilitats. Introduïu la tarifa i la càrrega fixa de la vostra pròpia factura; aquesta eina no obté tarifes en viu ni recomana plans.","record_id":"87aaf83fd0fbc9534cc8bcd677ebe84bd20112264869d436566be96ddc581fd7","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41185047487","seconds":1.174908335749933,"source":"Estimate only. Actual energy can differ because appliances cycle, draw standby power or use different settings. Your bill may also include time-of-use rates, taxes, tiered pricing and utility-specific fees. Enter the rate and fixed charge from your own bill; this tool does not fetch live rates or recommend plans.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"f8dcfd22e5e7ab9d7e0ff514f84f7ff56fb7cbe938f3c9b11d6629b6b7785160","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Només una estimació. L' energia real pot diferir perquè els aparells fan cicles, treuen energia en espera o usen diferents arranjaments. La vostra factura també pot incloure tarifes de temps d' ús, impostos, preus escalonats i tarifes específiques de les utilitats. Introduïu la tarifa i la càrrega fixa de la vostra pròpia factura; aquesta eina no obté tarifes en viu ni recomana plans.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
